WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.600
In the Heian era, Fujiwara Sai

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.600
After a great span of time

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Was reborn in the heart of Shindou Hikaru

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.400
To master the Move Of God

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.130
You are holding me up strong

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.300
I am holding you as well

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:26.130
So let us now while wandering, live together

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.810
towards the future

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:40.070
Even when I'm capricing with my friends

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.390
I feel an emptiness in my heart

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.100
Looked at with cold eyes

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.300
I'm blown by the winds of a dry age

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:59.930
Feelings of doubt and courage are back to back

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:08.390
but I'll make these dreams come true now with my own hands

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.190
The days where I'm hurt and about to break

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:20.140
The days where I cry and trouble you They all exist

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:24.340
but we will get over it heading

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.430
Higher then anyone else

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.000
Shindou Hikaru

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.700
Match #3 Akira's Fangs

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.600
Touya?

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:07.700
Touya... Right?
Touya?

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.700
Touya... Right?

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.300
What's up?

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:11.400
Nothing

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.500
You didn't attand the Igo tournament?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:17.500
You?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.800
Me? I just went to watch a little...

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:23.700
But, you know

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:27.600
That was the first time for me

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.500
There were kids even younger than me

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.000
Everyone was so serious

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.400
I was kinda impressed

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.300
Impressed?

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.000
You never became serious?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:45.700
Serious?

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.600
Can I see your hand?

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:49.800
My hand?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.600
His nails aren't scraped

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.200
I can't believe that this hand often touches Go stones

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:58.800
What are you doing?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:02:59.900
Ah, sorry

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.700
Are you... going to be a pro?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:04.800
Pro?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.800
Me, a pro?

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.700
I never even thought of such a thing

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.600
Touya, you wanna be a pro?

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:14.800
I will

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.200
I see

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.200
you're trying to become a pro

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.400
Does an Igo pro make alot of money?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.100
The title match prize is

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.200
36 million yen for 'Meijin'

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.800
A 'Kisei' match is 42 million yen

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.700
Hey wait, how many title matches are there?

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.100
What if you win them all?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.800
There are 8 total

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.100
A total prize money of about 1.8 billion yen

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.600
O-One billion..?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.600
Sai, with your skill it'll be a piece of cake

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.300
to win the 'Meijin' match, right?

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.000
Playing Go for money

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.900
Well, just for a little bit?

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.400
Ah, become a pro for a little bit

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.800
I was just thinking

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:05.000
one or two titles isn't such a bad idea

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.100
Become pro for just a little bit..

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:10.300
Just win one or two titles?

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:12.600
Stop joking around…

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.800
Those words are a insult to all Go players

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:17.800
I…

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.700
You must not be a true Go player

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.300
A person who truly plays Go would never say such disgusting things

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.700
Become pro for just a little

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.900
Do you know what my father has endured?

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.700
Perseverance, effort, Hardship, distress

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Overcoming the greatrest despair

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:38.000
And still there are those that have failed to reach my fathers level

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:41.100
Its not only my father, I've watched others…

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.400
And you dare say..

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:47.200
I've been trying to reach that level, knowing what I'll go through

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.900
Since I was little, everyday, everyday

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.000
I practiced Go for hours

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.900
I kept playing no matter how much I suffered

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:59.800
How did I lose to such a kid

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.000
Why don't we go play a game right now?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.000
I will become a pro

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.400
One day I will

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:15.600
If you can become a pro and win titles without going through any of the hardships

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.800
Then it's out of the question for you to lose to me now

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.300
Let's play now

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.300
Sai, what should we do?

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.300
Fine

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.100
Yeah

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.800
All I live for is to master a "Move of God"

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.300
I can't lose to him now

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.800
Shindou Hikaru is definitly not a beginner

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.100
I can't relax

00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.900
But he plays with a very old style

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.300
Shuusaku's Kosumi, too

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.700
That technique was used back then because there was no 'Komi' rule

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:49.600
That's it

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:52.000
That's where my chance lies

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.900
He got so angry..

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.100
People usually that

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.600
as a joke

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:58.800
Joke?

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:00.800
Was that really a joke?

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.900
Why can't you all take as a joke?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.600
Besides

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.900
Your last win was only by 2 moku

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.400
So, you only have skills equal to that

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.700
of an elementary school kid

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:15.800
You can become a pro

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.900
and just get a title easly? Its not possible

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.700
Hikaru, During the last match

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.400
I wasn't serious

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.900
That was instructive Go

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.000
Instructive Go?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.000
The purpose of instructive Go

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:32.500
Is to lead the opponent to the right path

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.100
An instructor doesn't play roughly for

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:36.700
the purpose of winning

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.800
Then, you're a lot stronger than him?

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.500
But, he's just an elementary school kid like me

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.500
It's normal for you to be stronger than him

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.100
Just now, what did you say, Hikaru?

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.400
He isn't a mere elementary school kid

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.000
Though he's still young

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.800
He shines in every move he plays

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.800
His every move..

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.800
I feel it revitalize me and drive me on

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:08.400
When he grows up. Will he become a Lion?, Or a Dragon?

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:14.500
And now, he is showing his fangs

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.100
I'm going to borrow an empty table

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:22.300
Akira-Kun
I'm going to borrow an empty table

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.000
Akira-Kun

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:24.300
you're…

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:25.500
Hello

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:26.600
It's that kid

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.600
That's right, that time

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:31.200
The one who defeated Akira-Kun…

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.500
That's right, thats the kid

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.100
Wait a..

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:42.800
Please

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:50.200
He's so confident that he doesn't even care about the gallery

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.600
'Tagaisen' is okay, right

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.600
'Tagisen'.. is that the rule where white gets 'komi'

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:58.600
I'll grab the stones

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.000
I won. It's even

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.400
I'm black, right?

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.100
Komi is 5 and a half moku

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.300
Please

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:30.900
thank you

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:33.400
Sai?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.000
17-4, upper right 'komoku'

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.800
17-4

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.300
Now, what should I do

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.700
This promising child with such bright eyes

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:49.300
But now, he is showing his fangs…

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.000
Shall I dodge his fangs

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.500
with a very slight difference

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.500
And give him a small pat on the head

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.000
Or…

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.200
He's taking 3 minutes for his first move

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:12.900
It's 'Hoshi'

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.000
16-17

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.400
16-17

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.000
Another 'Hoshi', again?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.200
In the Shuusaku era, we could never think of such a strategy

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.800
People must have studied alot for

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.500
these past 140 years

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.100
However

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.100
With 5 and a half moku disadvantage..

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.500
Playing against someone the same level as me

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.800
I will be at a great disadvantage

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.700
I must delve deeper

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.400
into the functions of a move

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:51.500
15-3

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.400
Searching after the 'Best Move'

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.900
What joy I feel

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.000
Whats wrong with him, Is he seriously that angry?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:12.600
The next move, If I 'kosumi' here, it may become easy for him

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.000
Then, 'hasami' may be faster

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.600
Is he waiting for me to 'kosumi'

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.300
Then, thats fine too

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.900
15-16, 'Kosumi'

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.000
Now! Come on

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.200
I can't

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.400
Sai?

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.300
It's 'Choushi'

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.600
He just declared his lose

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:04.500
But we only played about half as long last time

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.200
Touya, you were amazing

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.100
Your seriousness is almost scary

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:28.800
Your fighting spirit attacked me in every move

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.000
Those kids at the national tournament were great, but..

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.900
Really... Everyone was serious

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.700
He's not listening

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:48.800
He's not listening to... My words

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.600
I'm gonna.. Go home

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:54.500
See you

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:04.600
Father

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:07.100
Father!

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.800
Dad, do I have a talent for Igo?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.800
A talent for Igo

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:21.100
I don't know whether you have it or not

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.300
Even if you don't

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.900
you have two greater talents

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:32.900
One is a talent to always put more effort than anyone else

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.700
The other is a talent to love Igo with no limit

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:39.800
Father...

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:44.700
Until now, I've always been proud of those words

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.400
I've always kept moving foward

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.900
But now… There is an invisible wall in front of me

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.800
A great… Invisible… Wall…

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.100
Why did you win like that?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:11.400
Weren't you goning to win by 2 moku?

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.700
Hey, Sai

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:21.600
That child, he gave me no choice but to cut neck and body with one swing

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:27.400
He didn't give me any room to pat his head

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.400
What on Earth was that

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.600
Supprised me

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.700
You never become serious?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.500
Serious...

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.500
And it was funny

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.200
A long long time ago, there was

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:11.100
an old man and an old women in thier neighborhood.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.800
Hey are you listening to me?

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.300
Hikaru!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.400
Your home is this way

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:26.800
Later

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.800
Are you going to Igo school again?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.000
I dont have class at Igo school today

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.400
Geez!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.800
You're the worst

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.700
Touya, What does your seriousness mean?

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.600
What is Igo?

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.700
Are you also trying to master a

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.200
"Move of God" like Sai?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.700
Hikaru, Are you going to play Go today?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.600
Don't want to

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.100
But you already came here..

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.000
Right now I don't feel like it

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:04.700
You, Wait!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:06.500
Sensei

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.500
I just found the boy outside

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.300
That boy

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.100
The one who gave advice

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.000
on the 1's 2nd at the Igo Tournament

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.300
Oh, it's you again

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.600
Akira-Kun isn't here today

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:21.900
I see

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.600
You are the one who defeated Akira

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.300
Huh, I've seen you somewhere

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:31.300
That time

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.100
The one closest to a 'Move of God'

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.200
Touya's dad

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.700
I want to know your level

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.000
Sit down

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.900
Ah, no…

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:46.200
Hikaru! Let me play against him
Ah, no…

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.200
Hikaru! Let me play against him

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:53.300
When I exisited as 'Honninbo' Shusaku

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.700
There were many skilled players who chanllanged me

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.100
This man's spirit, Is exactly the same as there's

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.100
Lay out 3 stones

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.900
I always play with Akira like this

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.100
That is Akira's level

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:21.000
This man has the same eyes as Touya

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.300
Sai must also

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.700
Only I'm somewhat left out..

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.600
I..

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:42.200
I want to play

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.200
I..

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:46.700
Here I go

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.900
5-3 'Kakari'

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.900
5-3

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.300
Cool!

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:08.000
3-3 'Tsuke'

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.600
I thought the way Touya lays his stones was good, but..

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:12.700
This person

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.100
I have taught Akira Go  since he was 2 years old

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.500
He plays me every morning

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.100
His level is already that of a pro

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.300
Amazing

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.500
It looks like his fingertips are shining!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.400
4-4 'Hoshi'

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.900
I won't let him play in the amateur tournaments

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.000
If he plays in the children's tournament

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.300
he may crush the hopes of other children

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.600
He is that exceptional!

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:42.800
That is why I can't believe

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:46.000
there is a child who can defeat Akira

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:47.800
3-2 'Sagari'

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.800
He grabs the stones and..

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.100
Holds it inbetween his fingers

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.200
Those fingers guide it out onto the board

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.500
The fingertips shining

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.540
If I…

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:10.300
Could also lay the stones like that

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.000
10-16 'Hoshi'

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:17.800
If I.. Lay like that

00:20:19.100 --> 00:20:21.300
Lay like that

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:29.800
Hikaru

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.750
where is it
どこにあるのかな

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.580
The treasure that belongs to me
ボクだけの宝物

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:56.500
Now towards a great adventure
今　大きな冒険へ

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:59.140
The gentle sunlight
やわらかな日差し

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.530
A feeling of depature
旅立ちの予感

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:05.550
The sky and the flower are both laughing
空も花も　ホラ 笑っている

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:10.470
I wonder what waits ahead for me
この先には何が待つのだろう

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.660
Take A deep breath
深呼吸

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:20.900
Place your hand gently on the door to your dreams, and let's go
夢の扉にそっと手をかけて　行こう

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.000
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.800
While rocking your heart
心揺らしながら

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:29.300
holding a blank map in one hand
真っ白な地図を片手に持ちながら

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.100
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.250
While drawing in tomorrow
明日を描きながら

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:34.880
far away until I
遠くまで　何処まで

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:37.500
reach that place
たどり着けるまで

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.600
I won't lose, I wont cry
絶対負けないよ　絶対泣かないよ

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:46.110
Until the day that i make this dream come true
この夢を叶えるその日までは

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.990
The sky was laughing
あの空は笑っていた

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.030
That flower was laughing too
あの花は笑っていた

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.780
Some day I will laugh with you
ボクもいつか笑うから

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:58.070
I will surpass any obstacle
どんな壁も越えるから

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:03.550
I'm not afraid of anything any more
もう　何も何も　コワクナイ

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:11.920
梅澤由香里的GOGO圍棋

00:22:13.760 --> 00:22:15.490
今天也要開始的圍棋教室

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:17.460
可是看不到有紀了

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:23.020
你怎麼穿成這樣啊

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:26.050
因為今天是職業棋手的打法

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:28.510
那和你這樣子沒有關係吧

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:32.030
不過 由香里姐姐 要怎樣才能當職業棋士呢

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:37.600
嗯 我所在的日本棋院 每年有一次考試

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:39.900
合格的大概有五六人吧

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:43.570
要當職業棋士真是辛苦啊

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:45.000
是啊

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:47.400
可是如果有紀努力的話 說不定也能當職業...

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:52.870
（就算是小孩子 通過考試的話
也可以當職業棋士的）

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:54.710
我也想吃

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:56.410
待續…
我也想吃

00:22:56.410 --> 00:22:56.900
待續…

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:00.190
什麼塔矢亮

00:23:00.720 --> 00:23:03.660
那傢伙還不是我的手下敗將

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:05.810
你說你贏了塔矢？

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:11.970
小光 算了吧 我覺得他的好勝心很強

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:26.370
小鬼 少自以為是了
